mic movement terrorist movement in  the world in world history  and we should have more intelligent  solutions and  in the fighting against them we must  leave it there it's fascinating to talk  to you german author and journalist  spend ten days embedded with islamic  state fighters we appreciate you taking  the time to talk to us today thank you  thank you very much more in just a  moment

